# Build output and local state (machine-generated, never commit)
*.sb3
debug/
tools/scratchvm-profile/
tools/scratchvm-profiles/
tools/scratchhost/node_modules/
tools/scratchhost/vendor/
/.tools/
tools/.gsdev-port
__pycache__/

# Local Kilo state (agent-manager sessions, local settings)
/.kilo/

# Local planning/handoff notes (not part of the shipped repo).
# Listed explicitly rather than with a blanket `*.md`: that pattern silently
# dropped shipped docs such as tools/BENCHMARKS.md, and would swallow a future
# LICENSE.md / CONTRIBUTING.md / docs/**. README.md, AGENTS.md and tools/*.md
# are intended to ship.
handoff*.md
handover-*.md
plan-*.md
rtcfinding.md
AGENTS-internal.md
agents_staging.txt
*_review.txt

# Local perf-investigation reference screenshots
rtc-cost.png
write-test.png

# Staged AGENTS.md content, applied at commit time (avoids per-edit prompts)
agents_staging.txt

# Local-only fixture/demo projects and test suites (not part of the shipped repo)
examples/
tests/

# Local investigation harnesses, kept on disk for further local work but never
# shipped. None of these is referenced by the shipped docs or by gsdev/gsbridge:
#   tools/blockcost          op-execution-cost inventory + RTC bench harness
#   test_block_inventory     its offline drift check
#   gsbench (+ tests)        fixed-work before/after benchmark; its verdicts
#                            proved not actionable in practice
#   benchmarks/assignment    the gsbench reference scenario
tools/blockcost/
tools/test_block_inventory.py
tools/gsbench.py
tools/gsbench.js
tools/BENCHMARKS.md
tools/test_gsbench.py
tools/test_gsbench_js.cjs
tools/benchmarks/assignment*

# Maintainer-only checks, not used by end users or by agents iterating a project
# (run them locally when changing the harness itself):
#   test_perf_controls      perf-run setup (dialogs/occlusion/ports), no browser
#   test_procedure_profile  profiler attribution invariant, end to end
#   benchmarks/profiling    the fixture that test needs
tools/test_perf_controls.py
tools/test_procedure_profile.py
tools/test_bridge_targets.py
tools/benchmarks/profiling/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
